Logan,

I appreciate the attempt you made here, but I think it is caused by a misun=
derstanding.

That thing with Leaf? I think you learned the wrong thing from it. Our firs=
t exchange was natural. The next day it was clinical. It was unnatural. And=
 when I asked for clarity, he doubled down.

I was never upset with him. I just saw the change in behavior and felt it w=
as inauthentic. And I don't do inauthentic.

You can be real with me. I don't need to be managed.

If you need me to cover a shift, you know I'm the easiest person in the wor=
ld to ask. And I know you are just being thoughtful.

Sam

